2A. The following goods are regulated goods for the purposes of section 12(1)(b) of the Act, if they are not used or second-hand goods:
(a)any air-conditioner described in Part 1 of the First Schedule, from the date specified opposite that air-conditioner in the third column;
(b)any clothes dryer described in Part 1 of the Second Schedule, from the date specified opposite that clothes dryer in the third column;
(c)any refrigerator described in Part 1 of the Fourth Schedule, from the date specified opposite that refrigerator in the third column;
(d)any television described in Part 1 of the Fifth Schedule, from the date specified opposite that television in the third column;
(e)any motor described in Part 1 of the Sixth Schedule, from the date specified opposite that motor in the third column;
(f)any water heater described in Part 1 of the Eighth Schedule, from the date specified opposite that water heater in the third column.
[S 382/2026 wef 01/07/2026]

